# Raw per-take capture wavs = SOURCE but large (96k). Archival strategy
# (git-lfs vs external) UNDECIDED — see README/RESEARCH. Kept out of plain git
# for now to avoid bloat; the take_NNN.yaml sidecars ARE tracked.
# (Reference sweeps in sweeps/ stay tracked — small, needed for reproducible deconv.)
captures/**/*.wav
experiments/**/*.wav
app/*.log
sweep.wav
untitled folder/

